  "message/data/event/object/udb22_322_nameress_ev_find.txt/0": "要聊聊吗？",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_322_nameress_ev_talk.txt/10": "光之灾厄对世界的影响",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_322_nameress_ev_talk.txt/55": "关于强大的怪物",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_322_nameress_ev_talk.txt/92": "关于拉比斯",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_322_nameress_ev_talk.txt/119": "详细讲讲魅力！",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_322_nameress_ev_talk.txt/163": "详细讲讲游戏评价",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_322_nameress_ev_talk.txt/0": "那就聊聊吧。\r\n你想谈什么？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_322_nameress_ev_talk.txt/1": "\\c[52]光之灾厄\\c[0]并不只是\r\n吞没大地和海洋，\r\n它还对整个世界造成了各种影响。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_322_nameress_ev_talk.txt/2": "怪物正变得愈发凶暴，\r\n各地甚至发现了破坏城镇和地下城墙壁后\r\n继续前进的怪物。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_322_nameress_ev_talk.txt/3": "自从那场灾厄出现后，\r\n还发生了无法辨认对方身份、\r\n分不清敌友的现象。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_322_nameress_ev_talk.txt/4": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]大人是否见过\r\n\\c[52]泛着红光的怪物\\c[0]？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_322_nameress_ev_talk.txt/5": "泛红光的怪物\r\n代表其攻击力非常高。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_322_nameress_ev_talk.txt/6": "若我方毫无防备，\r\nHP的\\c[53]1/3\\c[0]一定会被削去。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_322_nameress_ev_talk.txt/7": "遇到那种敌人时，我建议逃跑。\r\n就算要战斗，也需要好装备、\r\n好物品和好技能。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_322_nameress_ev_talk.txt/8": "此外，在Normal及以上难度旅行时，\r\n还会遇到率领怪群的当地首领。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_322_nameress_ev_talk.txt/9": "这些首领往往拥有特殊能力，\r\n有的能飞行、有的会喷火、\r\n有的拥有诅咒之力，种类繁多。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_322_nameress_ev_talk.txt/10": "有时会出现受保护动物的群体。\r\n打倒群体首领没关系，\r\n但打倒手下会被保护团体盯上，请小心。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_322_nameress_ev_talk.txt/11": "您应该知道，\\c[52]拉比斯\\c[0]是\r\n这个世界的货币，\r\n各种交易都需要它。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_322_nameress_ev_talk.txt/12": "在城镇里有想要的东西，\r\n但钱不够时，\r\n可以卖掉物品。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_322_nameress_ev_talk.txt/13": "有机会出售时，\r\n就把不需要的东西积极卖掉吧。\r\n拉比斯不会占用重量。"
}
